  "notes": "WORD FORMATION:\n・{開|かい} (open) + {閉|へい} (close)\n・A compound combining opposite actions\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{開閉|かいへい}ボタン (open/close button)\n・{開閉|かいへい}{式|しき} (opening type, opening mechanism)\n・{自動|じどう}{開閉|かいへい} (automatic opening/closing)\n・{手動|しゅどう}{開閉|かいへい} (manual opening/closing)\n\nUSAGE CONTEXTS:\n・Doors and gates\n・Windows\n・Lids and covers\n・Electrical circuits ({回路|かいろ}の{開閉|かいへい})\n\nSIMILAR COMPOUND WORDS:\n・{出入|でい}り (going in and out)\n・{売買|ばいばい} (buying and selling)\n・{発着|はっちゃく} (arrival and departure)",
